  "details": "Video demonstration:\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PzWc3eq5PD0\nIn Desktop, if the player is in a moving station and the player moves away, parts of the VRChat menu break. (Social and world tab, maybe more)\nIf the player returns to the position where they opened the menu, the station works again.\n**Reproduction steps**\nGo to blueasis' recently updated Junkyard world. It's pretty!\nGo to the spinning windmill, and sit on it.\nObserve that the menu breaks a few seconds after opening the menu. However, after every full rotation of the windmill, the menu works for a moment.",
